the n0 is follow samplerate=half
the n1 is highpass samplerate=quarter
the n2 is pulsar tune=-0.27
the n3 is svf
the n4 is switch
n4.step -> n0
n4.step -> n1
n1 ~> n1.cutoff
n0 -> n1.res
n0 ~> n3
rocker -> n4
n4.step -> n4.in2
n3 -> n4.in3
value 20 -> n4.reset
n2 -> left
n0 -> out
n1 -> left
n1 -> leds
